This repository includes map data from third parties, listed below with its source and terms.
The pages that rankmap builds embed shapes from these files.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/us-states-albers.topo.json
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

An unmodified copy of states-albers-10m.json from us-atlas 3.0.1
(https://github.com/topojson/us-atlas, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/us-atlas@3.0.1/states-albers-10m.json),
by Mike Bostock, under the ISC License below.
us-atlas derives it from the U.S. Census Bureau's cartographic boundary files, 2017 edition
(https://www2.census.gov/geo/tiger/GENZ2017/shp/), projected with d3.geoAlbersUsa.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/maps/CA-counties.json
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

California's counties, cut out of counties-albers-10m.json from us-atlas 3.0.1
(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/us-atlas@3.0.1/counties-albers-10m.json), under the ISC License below,
and moved and rescaled by tools/maps/extract_counties.py.
us-atlas derives it from the U.S. Census Bureau's cartographic county boundaries, 2017 edition
(https://www2.census.gov/geo/tiger/GENZ2017/shp/).
A State's tools/maps/<ST>-counties.json made the same way has the same source and terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/maps/CA-districts.json
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Los Angeles Unified and Oakland Unified school district outlines, from the U.S. Census Bureau's
2024 cartographic boundary file of California's unified school districts, cb_2024_06_unsd_500k
(https://www2.census.gov/geo/tiger/GENZ2024/shp/cb_2024_06_unsd_500k.zip),
projected and rescaled by tools/maps/extract_districts.py.
Each State's tools/maps/<ST>-districts.json comes the same way from the Census Bureau's
cartographic boundary file of that State's unified school districts,
cb_<year>_<State FIPS>_unsd_500k (https://www2.census.gov/geo/tiger/GENZ<year>/shp/),
and its "source" field names the file it was made from.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/maps/label-spots.json
